
  <sn><md>### `/* */` Delimited Comments

A `/* */` comment begins with a forward slash followed immediately by an asterisk (`/*`) and ends when an asterisk is immediately followed by a forward slash (`*/`).

Everything between `/*` and `*/` is treated as a comment and is essentially **ignored by the compiler**.

```c
/* this is a comment */
```

</md></sn>
